0210624-1/cd0f4a136f7545eed9467e557752fdb8.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "朱元冰,戚砚笛,于文文", "director": "张瀚文", "content": "<p>江湖上突发两件大事。第一件，武林盟主江清流走火入魔，武功全失。第二件，江家囚禁三十年的魔头薄野景行逃走了。数日后，当一个软香温玉的女人被装在锦盒送到江清流手中时，他整个人都不好了，盒子里躺着的居然是打伤他后逃走的薄野景行。为了掩盖江家一直以来关押的魔头只是“一介女流”的糗事，江清流只得自认金屋藏娇的色狼，将她安置在自家宅院静观其变，谁料她竟在“女神”和“女神经”之间自由切换，一边情深意切地呵护他的“白莲花”，一边别有用心地怀上了他的骨肉。真相却渐渐浮出水面，薄野景行一心追查的三十年前血屠师门的凶手，其实和江清流难脱干系。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/UCnSMNmBGe1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/fec8gt7uw31/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/DrZNRS9H2a1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/AZqefhb79k1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/XRE0kudqDU1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/Ym0dgsh5L71/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/frhLF8bwt11/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/KaKFCQk7JV1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/m3nYpwjKXf1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/5YRt49jWUs1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/TurmrM6U941/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/7MmQz4UJzi1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/31/US0ZTeRjpN1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/f5tivSgu1d1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第15集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/gZm0VbGe6j1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第16集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/S3uyqE3Zye