": "cat_3fc0b225a0_part85.json"}, {"id": 86, "title": "不说再见", "category": "国产剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210624-1/27241631d2ab77fc3e15ddbccc41dc37.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "任嘉伦,张钧甯,寇世勋", "director": "殷飞,王磊", "content": "<p>三年前由于刑警刘远文的情报失误，使得其未婚妻、新晋刑警荣钰命丧毒贩伙拼的火场。缉毒大队刑警荣耀由于妹妹之死与好兄弟刘远文反目成仇，刘远文心灰意冷离开警局不知去向，而荣耀则为了报仇，经过三年的不断努力，成为了云港市禁毒大队队长。为了摧毁贩毒K集团并挖出背后国际贩毒组织头目“幽灵”，市公安局抽调资源成立了“84小组”，荣耀为报仇毅然接下组长一职，却不料小组的第一个任务，竟是为“K”集团中仅存的卧底刘远文提供支持，助其上位，接触K组织核心。于是，现实的无情，让背负命运折磨的二人，只能选择再度合作，随着一步步接近真相，二人却发现荣钰也许还活着。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/26/5RGkuCBSk51/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/26/kXyrjAfB1y1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/CmvpJtPpY61/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/J5Rux6hLDk1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/cH3rPCeRPg1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/LSYt5jkvCG1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/26/ACR7BxAfcf1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/26/Svw0jf5rJ71/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/26/8S9q5TmJi21/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/zEVf1T06HB1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/bqYdLjYptd1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/ZtPGvNk4F51/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/26/Bx6eT97yRp1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/26/8viRffnUR01/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第15集", "url": "https://v4.wuji